Id: init012e
Severity: ERROR
Category: tigris
Check: tiger tigris
Fix: Name a report the user running Tigris can read; run both runs as the same user.
References: tigris(8)

The report named after --since cannot be read: it does not exist, or
the user running Tigris may not read it. Reports are written readable by
their owner only, so a run as an ordinary user cannot compare with a run
made as root.
